# Automotive AI Analytics Assistant

## Overview

This project explores how generative AI can support business intelligence by enabling users to interact with automotive industry data through natural-language questions.

The objective is to develop an AI-powered analytics assistant that can retrieve relevant information, use analytical tools, and communicate results in a clear and useful format.

## Objectives

- Enable natural-language exploration of automotive sales data.
- Connect AI applications to structured datasets and analytical functions.
- Implement tool calling for retrieving business metrics.
- Explore AI agent workflows and Model Context Protocol (MCP).
- Evaluate response accuracy and reliability.

## Technologies

Python · Generative AI · Large Language Models · Prompt Engineering · AI Agents · MCP · GitHub

## Planned Features

- Natural-language queries about automotive sales performance
- Data retrieval and KPI calculation tools
- AI agent integration
- MCP-based tool access
- Prompt testing and response evaluation
- Documentation of system design and limitations

## Data Sources

The assistant will use validated automotive industry datasets and analysis outputs developed in the Business Intelligence and Forecasting projects.

